OK   my re-implementation of the gadgets builds exactly the library's NFA (852 expressions of size <= 5)
OK   Thompson's NFA accepts exactly L(R) (independent matcher, |w| <= 5, all those expressions)
OK   every gadget is entered only at its start state and left only from its accepting state
